{"title":"Smart Watches Under 7000","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"terra-fit-smart-watch","title":"Terra Fit Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"241\" data-end=\"599\"\u003eThe Terra Fit Smartwatch is designed for active lifestyles that demand reliability, smart connectivity, and everyday comfort. With Bluetooth calling support, health tracking essentials, and a durable sporty build, Terra Fit helps you stay connected, track your fitness, and manage daily tasks effortlessly—whether you’re working out, commuting, or unwinding.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"899\"\u003eBuilt around a practical full-touch display and powered by a single-chip Bluetooth calling system, Terra Fit delivers smooth performance with essential smart features that matter most. Its long battery life, water resistance, and fitness-focused tools make it a dependable companion for daily wear.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Rose Pink","offer_id":51181307920662,"sku":"22850","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":44679171735830,"sku":"18564","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver Grey","offer_id":44679171768598,"sku":"18577","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red Berry","offer_id":44679171703062,"sku":"18576","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":44679171834134,"sku":"18575","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Olive Green","offer_id":44679171801366,"sku":"18578","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/1_df601d00-3118-441f-ac86-ce5b8f69a31a.webp?v=1776933536"},{"product_id":"ignite-smart-watch","title":"Ignite Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eIgnite your style with Ignite Smart Watch: Boasting a 1.83\" TFT Display, 100+ Watch Faces \u0026amp; a unique Duo Colored Crown. Redefine your look with every touch!!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eIgnite Smart Watch Description!\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Ignite \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmart Watch\u003c\/a\u003e, available at ZeroLifestyle, combines cutting-edge technology with sleek design. Ideal for fitness enthusiasts and tech-savvy individuals, this smartwatch offers an array of features to keep you connected, healthy, and stylish.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Ignite Smart Watch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Ignite Smart Watch features a vibrant full-color touch display, ensuring clear visibility in any lighting.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith continuous heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and fitness tracking, you can stay on top of your health goals.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe watch also includes a step counter and calorie tracker. Smart notifications allow you to receive calls, texts, and social media alerts directly on your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Ignite Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: Full-color touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHealth Tracking: Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eActivity Tracking: Steps, calories, various exercise modes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Multi-day battery life on a single charge\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCustomization: Multiple watch faces\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Ignite Smart Watch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Ignite Smart Watch offers comprehensive tracking features to provide valuable insights into your daily activities and sleep patterns, helping you make informed health decisions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts ability to receive notifications directly on your wrist ensures you stay connected effortlessly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith its sleek design and customizable watch faces, the Ignite Smart Watch is a versatile accessory for any occasion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":46752558317846,"sku":"19611","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":47069377462550,"sku":"19616","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Grey","offer_id":47069377495318,"sku":"19615","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":46752557957398,"sku":"19612","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Green Gold","offer_id":46752558252310,"sku":"19613","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red","offer_id":46752558285078,"sku":"19614","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/ignite_black-1.webp?v=1773924771"},{"product_id":"luna-smart-watch","title":"Luna Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eSwitch towards infinite possibilities with the Luna Smartwatch, styled through a cosmic full metal body with a 1.39” HD Display and IP67 Water Resistance. With a fully functioning AI Assistant, Luna keeps you connected at every moment. Strap into the future of smartwatches with Active Weather Forecasting, BT Calling, and sleek strap designs.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Luna:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e1.39” HD Display\u003cbr\u003eIP67 Water Resistance\u003cbr\u003eActive Weather Forecasting\u003cbr\u003eBT Calling\u003cbr\u003eSmart Notifications\u003cbr\u003eActive Health Suites\u003cbr\u003eWorkout Modes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Luna:\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay\u003c\/strong\u003e: Full-color touch screen\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHealth Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eActivity Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e: Steps, calories, various exercise modes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e: Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e: Long-lasting, multi-day battery life on a single charge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization\u003c\/strong\u003e: Multiple customizable watch faces\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003esmartwatches\u003c\/a\u003e and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":47069797450006,"sku":"20081","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gray","offer_id":47069797548310,"sku":"20080","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":47069797515542,"sku":"20084","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pink Gold","offer_id":47069797482774,"sku":"20077","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":48148570308886,"sku":"20680","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Sporty Gray Rings","offer_id":48926634311958,"sku":"22477","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Sporty Red Rings","offer_id":48926630936854,"sku":"22479","price":4999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Luna-_5_3.webp?v=1776510284"},{"product_id":"nova-smart-watch","title":"Nova Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003eNova Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUpgrade your tech with the Nova Smartwatch, where innovation meets elegance. Make your daily routine more productive and stylish with a smartwatch designed to keep pace with your life. Order your Nova Smartwatch today and embrace the perfect blend of technology and fashion.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Nova Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Nova Smartwatch is equipped with a range of features to keep you on track and connected. Its advanced fitness tracking includes heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and various sports modes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStay updated with smart notifications for calls, messages, and social media alerts, all displayed on a vibrant, high-resolution screen. The long-lasting battery ensures you stay powered throughout your day, and customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps let you personalize your look.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Nova Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: 1.3-inch TFT full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 360 x 360 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer, gyroscope\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 45 x 38 x 10 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 7 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP68 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 40g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Nova SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOpting for the Nova Smartwatch means choosing a device that enhances your life with its advanced features and stylish design. Its comprehensive health tracking, seamless connectivity, and elegant appearance make it a top choice. Plus, with our dedicated customer support, you can enjoy a hassle-free experience from purchase to daily use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":47263090180374,"sku":"20096","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Golden","offer_id":47263090311446,"sku":"20101","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":47263090213142,"sku":"20097","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Nova Gray","offer_id":47263090344214,"sku":"20100","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":47263090245910,"sku":"20103","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Rainbow","offer_id":47263090278678,"sku":"20093","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Dark-Black.webp?v=1705740899"},{"product_id":"meta-smart-watch","title":"Meta Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2\u003eMeta Smart Watch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Meta Smart Watch, available at ZeroLifestyle, is a perfect fusion of advanced technology and sleek design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTailored for tech enthusiasts and fitness lovers, this smartwatch offers an extensive range of features to keep you connected, healthy, and stylish.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Meta Smart Watch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Meta \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmart Watch\u003c\/a\u003e features a vibrant full-color touch display that ensures clarity in all lighting conditions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt includes continuous heart rate monitoring, detailed sleep analysis, and precise fitness tracking to help you achieve your health goals.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe watch also has a step counter and calorie tracker. Smart notifications allow you to receive calls, texts, and social media alerts directly on your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Meta Smart Watch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisplay: Full-color touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHealth Tracking: Heart rate monitor, sleep analysis\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eActivity Tracking: Steps, calories, various exercise modes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Smart notifications for calls, texts, and social media\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Long-lasting, Multi-day battery life on a single charge\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCustomization: Multiple customizable watch faces\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Meta Smart Watch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoosing the Meta Smart Watch means investing in a device that supports your health and fitness while keeping you seamlessly connected.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts comprehensive tracking features provide valuable insights into your daily activities and sleep patterns, allowing you to make informed health decisions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe ability to receive notifications directly on your wrist ensures continuous connectivity.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWith its sleek design and customizable watch faces, the Meta Smart Watch is a versatile accessory for any occasion.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":47761659003158,"sku":"20451","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":47761659035926,"sku":"20452","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Rose Gold","offer_id":47761659068694,"sku":"20453","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/1_black_517c6694-e21e-48d4-9605-e2cebc7f9041.webp?v=1784637236"},{"product_id":"edge-smartwatch","title":"Edge Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch1\u003eThe Edge Smartwatch\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStylish and Durable Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Lightweight construction (22g) with a sturdy PC+ABS finish.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVivid TFT Display:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.83-inch screen with a resolution of 240×284 pixels.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eLong-Lasting Battery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 7–9 days of regular use and up to 35 days on standby. Quick charging in under 2.5 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eHealth and Fitness Tracking\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpO2 Level Measurement\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSleep Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBreathe Training\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMenstrual Cycle Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStress Management Tools\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCalories Burned Tracking\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eStay Connected\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eManage calls, messages, and notifications directly from your wrist.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCamera Control for snapping moments.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\"Find Phone\" feature for convenience.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eEveryday Tools\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAlarms, weather updates, flashlight, calculator, and motion gesture for screen activation.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSedentary, drink water, and hand wash reminders.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.83-inch TFT screen with 240×284 resolution.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Life:\u003c\/strong\u003e 7–9 days regular use, 35 days on standby.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e Less than 2.5 hours.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP68 rating for durability.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOperating System:\u003c\/strong\u003e Compatible with Android 9+ and iOS 12+.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3 with 10-meter transmission range.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Edge Smartwatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Edge \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatch \u003c\/a\u003edelivers a harmonious blend of functionality and style. With advanced health tracking, seamless connectivity, and practical everyday tools, it fits right into your lifestyle. Whether you're working, exercising, or relaxing, the Edge Smartwatch enhances every moment with its innovative features and long-lasting performance.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":49894865142038,"sku":"22878","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Midnight Blue","offer_id":49894865174806,"sku":"22879","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Gray","offer_id":49894865109270,"sku":"22943","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Rose Pink","offer_id":49894865240342,"sku":"22945","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Red Berry","offer_id":49894865207574,"sku":"22944","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/B1_218495a9-8f36-4abf-b51a-64671c0db56e.webp?v=1767865748"},{"product_id":"orbit-2","title":"Orbit 2 Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch3 data-end=\"159\" data-start=\"117\"\u003eOrbit 2 Smartwatch by Zero Lifestyle\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"187\" data-start=\"161\"\u003eFeatures of Product\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"361\" data-start=\"189\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"217\" data-start=\"189\"\u003eSleek and Durable Design\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"220\" data-start=\"217\"\u003eThe Orbit 2 Smartwatch is crafted to match both style and function, featuring a 1.38-inch round TFT screen with a sharp 240×240 resolution.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"705\" data-start=\"362\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"495\" data-start=\"362\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"495\" data-start=\"364\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"382\" data-start=\"364\"\u003ePremium Build:\u003c\/strong\u003e Zinc alloy middle frame, PC plastic bottom case, and anti-static silicone strap ensure durability and comfort.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"577\" data-start=\"496\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"577\" data-start=\"498\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"521\" data-start=\"498\"\u003eCompact Dimensions:\u003c\/strong\u003e Designed for a perfect wrist fit without adding bulk.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"705\" data-start=\"578\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"705\" data-start=\"580\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"606\" data-start=\"580\"\u003eIP68 Water Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e Withstands daily splashes, sweat, and rain, making it ideal for workouts and outdoor adventures.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"820\" data-start=\"712\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"753\" data-start=\"712\"\u003ePowerful Battery \u0026amp; Efficient Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"756\" data-start=\"753\"\u003eStay powered through busy days with a reliable battery system.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1063\" data-start=\"821\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"821\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"897\" data-start=\"823\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"840\" data-start=\"823\"\u003eExtended Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5–7 days of working time and up to 15 days on standby.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"898\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"900\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"919\" data-start=\"900\"\u003eQuick Recharge:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully charges in just 2.5–3 hours.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1063\" data-start=\"957\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1063\" data-start=\"959\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"980\" data-start=\"959\"\u003eReliable Battery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 220mAh polymer battery with Seiko board protection for long-lasting performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1182\" data-start=\"1070\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1104\" data-start=\"1070\"\u003eSeamless Wireless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"1107\" data-start=\"1104\"\u003eEnjoy smooth pairing and stable connections for all your smart functions.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1183\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1271\" data-start=\"1183\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1271\" data-start=\"1185\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1214\" data-start=\"1185\"\u003eLatest Bluetooth Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e Equipped with BLE 5.3 for fast, reliable transmission.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1335\" data-start=\"1272\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1335\" data-start=\"1274\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1293\" data-start=\"1274\"\u003eGenerous Range:\u003c\/strong\u003e Maintains connectivity up to 10 meters.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1336\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1435\" data-start=\"1338\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1362\" data-start=\"1338\"\u003eSmart Notifications:\u003c\/strong\u003e Stay on top of calls, messages, and app alerts directly on your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1551\" data-start=\"1442\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1480\" data-start=\"1442\"\u003eAdvanced Health \u0026amp; Fitness Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"1483\" data-start=\"1480\"\u003eTake charge of your health with comprehensive monitoring features.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1956\" data-start=\"1552\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1595\" data-start=\"1552\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1595\" data-start=\"1554\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1593\" data-start=\"1554\"\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring (LC09 Sensor)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1649\" data-start=\"1596\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1649\" data-start=\"1598\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1647\" data-start=\"1598\"\u003eBlood Oxygen (SpO₂) \u0026amp; Blood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1688\" data-start=\"1650\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1688\" data-start=\"1652\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1686\" data-start=\"1652\"\u003eSleep Monitoring (22:00–08:00)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1730\" data-start=\"1689\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1730\" data-start=\"1691\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1728\" data-start=\"1691\"\u003eBreath Training \u0026amp; Stress Function\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1791\" data-start=\"1731\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1791\" data-start=\"1733\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1789\" data-start=\"1733\"\u003ePedometer, Calories, Sedentary \u0026amp; Hydration Reminders\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1872\" data-start=\"1792\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1872\" data-start=\"1794\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1813\" data-start=\"1794\"\u003e8 Sports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Including walking, running, cycling, swimming, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1956\" data-start=\"1873\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1956\" data-start=\"1875\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1899\" data-start=\"1875\"\u003eGPS Motion Tracking:\u003c\/strong\u003e Via connected mobile app for precise activity mapping.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2054\" data-start=\"1963\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1997\" data-start=\"1963\"\u003eSmart Controls \u0026amp; Customization\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"2000\" data-start=\"1997\"\u003ePacked with features that make everyday life easier.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2419\" data-start=\"2055\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2105\" data-start=\"2055\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2105\" data-start=\"2057\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2103\" data-start=\"2057\"\u003eBluetooth Phone Calls \u0026amp; AI Voice Assistant\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2136\" data-start=\"2106\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2136\" data-start=\"2108\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2134\" data-start=\"2108\"\u003eCamera \u0026amp; Music Control\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2183\" data-start=\"2137\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2183\" data-start=\"2139\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2181\" data-start=\"2139\"\u003eWeather Forecast (Today + Next 6 Days)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2244\" data-start=\"2184\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2244\" data-start=\"2186\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2205\" data-start=\"2186\"\u003eDIY Watch Face:\u003c\/strong\u003e Customize with your favorite photos.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2305\" data-start=\"2245\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2305\" data-start=\"2247\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2303\" data-start=\"2247\"\u003eStopwatch, Countdown Timer, Calculator, Split Screen\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2392\" data-start=\"2306\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2392\" data-start=\"2308\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2335\" data-start=\"2308\"\u003eMulti-Language Support:\u003c\/strong\u003e Including Arabic, German, Japanese, Chinese, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2419\" data-start=\"2393\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2419\" data-start=\"2395\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2417\" data-start=\"2395\"\u003eFun Gaming Feature\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"2458\" data-start=\"2426\"\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2671\" data-start=\"2459\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2505\" data-start=\"2459\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2505\" data-start=\"2461\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2473\" data-start=\"2461\"\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.38\" TFT, 240×240 resolution\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2545\" data-start=\"2506\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2545\" data-start=\"2508\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2520\" data-start=\"2508\"\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 220mAh polymer battery\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2580\" data-start=\"2546\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2580\" data-start=\"2548\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2566\" data-start=\"2548\"\u003eCharging Time:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2.5–3 hours\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2607\" data-start=\"2581\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2607\" data-start=\"2583\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2597\" data-start=\"2583\"\u003eBluetooth:\u003c\/strong\u003e BLE 5.3\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2638\" data-start=\"2608\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2638\" data-start=\"2610\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2631\" data-start=\"2610\"\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP68\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2671\" data-start=\"2639\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2671\" data-start=\"2641\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"2658\" data-start=\"2641\"\u003eSports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e 8 built-in\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch4 data-end=\"2701\" data-start=\"2678\"\u003ePackage Includes\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"2759\" data-start=\"2702\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2724\" data-start=\"2702\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2724\" data-start=\"2704\"\u003eOrbit 2 Smartwatch\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2743\" data-start=\"2725\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2743\" data-start=\"2727\"\u003eCharging Cable\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"2759\" data-start=\"2744\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"2759\" data-start=\"2746\"\u003eUser Manual\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-end=\"2806\" data-start=\"2766\"\u003eWhy Choose the Orbit 2 Smartwatch?\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"3082\" data-start=\"2807\"\u003eDesigned for modern, active lifestyles, the Orbit 2 \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/smart-watches\"\u003eSmartwatches by Zero Lifestyle\u003c\/a\u003e blends advanced health monitoring, smart connectivity, and rugged durability. Whether you’re working out, staying productive, or just staying connected, the Orbit 2 is built to elevate your day.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Gray Silver","offer_id":50061363872022,"sku":"23116","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":50061363773718,"sku":"22808","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Coffee","offer_id":50061363839254,"sku":"23108","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black Gold","offer_id":50061363806486,"sku":"23110","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Marsala Gold","offer_id":50061363904790,"sku":"23112","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Pink Golden","offer_id":50061363937558,"sku":"23114","price":6999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/silver_4_35749c97-d365-44fc-aa24-b7b94532fa1a.webp?v=1776755793"},{"product_id":"luna-pro","title":"Luna Pro","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLuna Pro Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Luna Pro Smartwatch blends modern design with powerful health and lifestyle features, delivering a premium experience for everyday life. With advanced sensors, fitness tracking, and a customizable interface, Luna Pro keeps you connected, informed, and in control—wherever your day takes you.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures of the Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⌚ \u003cstrong\u003ePremium Build Quality\u003c\/strong\u003e – Zinc alloy middle frame with PC plastic bottom case and anti-static z\u003cspan\u003einc alloy frame\u003c\/span\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🖥 \u003cstrong\u003eVibrant Display\u003c\/strong\u003e – 1.38-inch TFT round screen with 240×240 resolution and full-screen touch support.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🔋 \u003cstrong\u003eReliable Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e – 220 mAh polymer battery provides \u003cstrong\u003e5–7 days of regular use\u003c\/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003e10–15 days standby\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e⚡ \u003cstrong\u003eFast Charging\u003c\/strong\u003e – Fully charges in \u003cstrong\u003e2.5–3 hours\u003c\/strong\u003e via magnetic USB cable.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e📱 \u003cstrong\u003eSeamless Connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e – Bluetooth 5.3 with call support, notifications, music control, and remote camera function.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e❤️ \u003cstrong\u003eComprehensive Health Tracking\u003c\/strong\u003e –\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHeart Rate Monitoring (LC09 Sensor)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBlood Oxygen (SpO2)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBlood Pressure Tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSleep Monitoring (22:00–8:00)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBreathing Exercises\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🏃 \u003cstrong\u003eFitness \u0026amp; Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e – Supports walking, running, cycling, skipping rope, basketball, soccer, badminton, and swimming, with GPS motion tracking via the \u003cstrong\u003eDaFit app\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🎨 \u003cstrong\u003eCustomizable Watch Faces\u003c\/strong\u003e – 4 pre-installed dials, 1 DIY custom face, and more available in the watch face market.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e🧠 \u003cstrong\u003eSmart Assistant \u0026amp; Tools\u003c\/strong\u003e – AI voice assistant, alarm, calculator, stopwatch, weather updates, sedentary and drink reminders, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e💧 \u003cstrong\u003eWaterproof Design\u003c\/strong\u003e – \u003cstrong\u003eIP68 water resistance\u003c\/strong\u003e, making it safe for daily use and light water exposure.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecifications of Product\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Zinc alloy frame + PC bottom + silicone strap\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDisplay:\u003c\/strong\u003e 1.38-inch TFT, 240×240 resolution, full-touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChipset:\u003c\/strong\u003e JIELI 7012F6\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMemory:\u003c\/strong\u003e RAM 640 KB \/ ROM 64 MB\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSensors:\u003c\/strong\u003e LC09 heart rate sensor, Minghao DA267 G-sensor\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery:\u003c\/strong\u003e 220 mAh polymer battery (5–7 days use, 10–15 days standby)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCharging:\u003c\/strong\u003e 2.5–3 hours magnetic charging\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBluetooth:\u003c\/strong\u003e 5.3, supports calls, music control, notifications\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSports Modes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Walking, running, cycling, skipping rope, basketball, soccer, badminton, swimming\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApp:\u003c\/strong\u003e DaFit (Android 5.0 + \/ iOS 9.0 +)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWater Resistance:\u003c\/strong\u003e IP68\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eExtra Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e AI voice assistant, remote camera, DIY watch face, split‑screen, built‑in game, OTA updates\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhy Choose Luna Pro Smartwatch?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Luna Pro Smartwatch is designed for users who demand performance, style, and versatility. From \u003cstrong\u003ehealth monitoring\u003c\/strong\u003e to \u003cstrong\u003esmartphone connectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e, it combines everyday convenience with fitness intelligence. With customizable watch faces, extended battery life, and IP68 water resistance, Luna Pro is more than a smartwatch—it’s your all‑day companion for work, workouts, and everything in between.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Black","offer_id":50337766244630,"sku":"23118","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":50337766277398,"sku":"23120","price":6499.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/BLACKWATCHFACE.webp?v=1755331884"},{"product_id":"qube-smartwatch","title":"Qube Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"202\" data-end=\"489\"\u003eStay connected, active, and in control with the \u003cstrong data-start=\"250\" data-end=\"269\"\u003eQube Smartwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e, designed to blend smart technology with everyday convenience. Featuring a vibrant full-touch display and a sleek, modern design, Qube keeps your notifications, fitness tracking, and health insights right on your wrist.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"808\"\u003eBuilt for daily performance, the Qube Smartwatch offers comprehensive health monitoring, smart notifications, and multiple sports modes to support your active lifestyle. Whether you're tracking workouts, managing calls, or monitoring your heart rate, Qube delivers reliable performance with long-lasting battery life.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"810\" data-end=\"967\"\u003eWith Bluetooth connectivity, intuitive controls, and a comfortable strap design, Qube is the perfect companion for work, workouts, and everything in between.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Starlight Silver","offer_id":51050937254166,"sku":"23888","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black","offer_id":51050937155862,"sku":"23814","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Gray Silver","offer_id":51050937188630,"sku":"23890","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Pink Rose","offer_id":51050937221398,"sku":"23889","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/CHAMPAGNE_01.webp?v=1773019308"},{"product_id":"bolt-pro","title":"Bolt Pro Smartwatch","description":"\u003ch2 data-end=\"200\" data-start=\"160\"\u003eBolt Pro Smartwatch – Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"104\" data-end=\"348\"\u003eThe ZERO BOLT PRO is a sleek and feature-rich smartwatch designed for everyday fitness, connectivity, and convenience. With its modern square dial and vibrant display, it delivers both style and smart functionality in one powerful wearable.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"366\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"1365\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"451\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"451\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"394\"\u003e1.83\" IPS HD Display\u003c\/strong\u003e – Large, bright screen for clear and immersive viewing\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"539\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"539\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"454\" data-end=\"487\"\u003eSingle Chip Bluetooth Calling\u003c\/strong\u003e – Make and receive calls directly from your watch\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"611\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"611\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"562\"\u003e100+ Watch Faces\u003c\/strong\u003e – Personalize your display to match your style\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"685\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"685\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"614\" data-end=\"635\"\u003e100+ Sports Modes\u003c\/strong\u003e – Track a wide range of workouts and activities\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"686\" data-end=\"750\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"750\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"721\"\u003eDynamic Heart Rate Monitoring\u003c\/strong\u003e – Real-time heart tracking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"804\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"804\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"772\"\u003eSpO₂ Monitoring\u003c\/strong\u003e – Monitor blood oxygen levels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"805\" data-end=\"878\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"878\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"831\"\u003eIP66 Water Resistant\u003c\/strong\u003e – Protection against dust and water splashes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"955\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"955\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"915\"\u003eQibla Direction \u0026amp; Prayer Times\u003c\/strong\u003e – Built-in Islamic lifestyle features\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"1007\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1007\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"976\"\u003eTasbih Counter\u003c\/strong\u003e – Convenient digital counter\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1075\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1075\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1010\" data-end=\"1033\"\u003eSmart Notifications\u003c\/strong\u003e – Receive call, message, and app alerts\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1129\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1129\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1095\"\u003eSync Contacts\u003c\/strong\u003e – Easy access to saved contacts\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1130\" data-end=\"1182\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1182\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1132\" data-end=\"1159\"\u003eVoice Assistant Support\u003c\/strong\u003e – Hands-free control\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1231\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1231\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1203\"\u003eBuilt-in Games\u003c\/strong\u003e – On-the-go entertainment\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1289\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1289\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1262\"\u003eAlarm, Timer \u0026amp; Stopwatch\u003c\/strong\u003e – Everyday utility tools\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1290\" data-end=\"1365\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1365\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1321\"\u003eUp to 5 Days Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e – Reliable performance on a single charge\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch3 data-start=\"1367\" data-end=\"1389\"\u003eAdditional Details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1555\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1417\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1417\"\u003e3D Colorful Dynamic UI\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1418\" data-end=\"1439\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1439\"\u003e365 Days Warranty\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1440\" data-end=\"1518\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1442\" data-end=\"1518\"\u003eCompatible with the ZERO Health app (available on App Store \u0026amp; Google Play)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1555\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1555\"\u003eMagnetic charging cable included\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1557\" data-end=\"1734\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"\u003eThe ZERO BOLT PRO combines fitness tracking, smart connectivity, and practical lifestyle tools making it ideal for daily wear, workouts, and staying connected anytime, anywhere.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Jet Black","offer_id":51061801943318,"sku":"23892","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Vintage brown","offer_id":51068077310230,"sku":"24132","price":5999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Graphite Mauve","offe